      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Flag used by addCrossProfileIntentFilter(ComponentName, IntentFilter, int) to allow activities in the managed profile to access intents sent from the parent profile. That is, when an app in the parent profile calls Activity.startActivity(Intent), the intent can be resolved by a matching activity in the managed profile.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/admin/DevicePolicyManager#FLAG_MANAGED_CAN_ACCESS_PARENT" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.admin.DevicePolicyManager.FLAG_MANAGED_CAN_ACCESS_PARENT</code>.</a></format></para>
